@startuml
title H08 - Hub cloud link
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #2877B5
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #17324D
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F4F7FA
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFF1BF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #9C6500
left to right direction
component "H08\nHub cloud link" as H08
interface "set_connected(); next_batch(); application_commit_ack(); record_failure()" as API
database "Owned state\nconnection flag, failure count and retry-after deadline; journal owns payload" as State
queue "Input / output\nCommitted outbox + connection/ACK → prioritized batch and retirement" as IO
API --> H08
IO --> H08
H08 --> State : owns
component "S01\nShared contracts" as S01
H08 ..> S01 : contract / port
component "H02\nHub persistence" as H02
H08 ..> H02 : contract / port
component "B03\nEvent ingestion" as B03
H08 ..> B03 : contract / port
component "B08\nOperations/data" as B08
H08 ..> B08 : contract / port
note bottom of H08
Flow: Send only when connected/due; prioritize Call family over history; use bounded reconnect schedule; retire on backend commit ACK.
Guard: Disconnect/backoff preserves outbox. Transport ACK cannot call application_commit_ack. Original event time is unchanged.
Status: Host complete; target pending
end note
@enduml
